    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "summary": "The Warhammer Event Companion also applies to Teams. When teams meet, their members fight separate battles. Each member plays one opponent from the other side in that matchup.\n\nMission setup. For Teams games, this section covers generating missions and laying out the battlefield.\n\nPlayer pairings and standings. The Teams guidance explains how to match players fairly and determine rankings.\n\nConsult the main companion for other guidance, including errata and FAQs.",
